WEBVTT

00:08:59.481 --> 00:09:04.170
A ja mu odgovorim, "FU." (j*i se) (Smijeh)

00:09:04.170 --> 00:09:05.926
On me na to upita

00:09:05.926 --> 00:09:07.600
zašto sam ga opsovao.

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:10.260
Ja mu odgovorim, "LOL FU,"

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:11.959
u smislu, napokon 
razumijem (finally understand).

00:09:11.959 --> 00:09:13.996
(Smijeh)

00:09:13.996 --> 00:09:17.261
Sada, tri godine poslije,

00:09:17.261 --> 00:09:19.135
ide mi relativno dobro.

00:09:19.135 --> 00:09:21.813
Imam stipendiju za Media Lab 
na Tehnološkom institutu Massachusetts,

00:09:21.813 --> 00:09:25.030
radim za fenomenalnu tvrtku 
koja se zove BMe,

00:09:25.030 --> 00:09:27.360
podučavam na Sveučilištu Michigan.

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:29.337
No, bilo je teško

00:09:29.337 --> 00:09:30.800
jer shvaćam da ima više